 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Properties of the maximal isomorphism open",
 "statement": "The subset $\\operatorname{IsoOpen}(q)$ is open,\n$q^{-1}(\\operatorname{IsoOpen}(q))\\to\\operatorname{IsoOpen}(q)$ is an\nisomorphism, and every open over which $q$ is an isomorphism is contained in\nit.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-nagata-compactification/sk-lem-nagata-sketch-near-closure/lemma-nagata-maximal-isomorphism-open.md",
